>
  <KeyTakeaways
    items={[
      'Potent melanocortin drugs that build pigment already exist — afamelanotide is an approved, far more potent and longer-lasting copy of α-MSH; Melanotan II and the oral candidate dersimelagon are others. What none of them is, is selective.',
